{
    "id": "MiniMaxH3Ref2VAChained",
    "description": "Letting a supplied asset decide how long the chain runs. 'match_audio' derives the segment count from the duration of the audio reference instead of a fixed number, slicing it into frame-aligned per-segment chunks so each segment is conditioned on its own slice and the final video is muxed against the original track. Continuity is still carried as a frame, but into a 'references' list rather than a plain image argument - the carry-over adapts to the pipeline argument it lands in.",
    "variables": {
        "prompt": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the astronaut in <Picture 1>, in a white hard-shell suit with a gold-mirrored visor, an orange chest harness and a soft-sided life-support pack.\n<Audio 1> is the speech track <Subject 1> (S1) is lip-synchronised to: a recorded male voiceover, mid-range in pitch, measured and formal in delivery.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reuse] The target video shows <Subject 1> delivering the speech carried by <Audio 1> directly to camera in the setting of <Picture 1>, in one continuous take.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the suit, visor, harness and proportions of <Picture 1> are kept exactly, with the head and shoulders newly animated to speak.\n<Audio 1>: partially_copy - the segment of the recording covering this part of the timeline is reused as <Subject 1>'s speech, and his mouth is synchronised to it.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in realistic photographic style. [Shot 1] A medium close-up frames <Subject 1> from the chest up, centred and facing camera, in the setting of <Picture 1>, held as one continuous shot. Warm low sunlight rakes across the left of the suit and reflects off the gold visor as a long soft highlight; the background sits well behind in shallow focus. <Subject 1> (S1) speaks continuously in a measured, formal male voice, his jaw and lips moving in natural synchronisation with <Audio 1> behind the open visor, pausing only where the recording pauses. Between phrases he shifts his weight very slightly and his head drifts a few degrees off centre and back, keeping his eyes on the lens. The camera holds a static shot throughout.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA broad, open outdoor room tone with a steady low wind moving across the microphone. The suit fabric and harness give a dry creak as he shifts his weight, and a faint regulator hiss cycles quietly under the speech from the first frame to the last.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA slow, sparse orchestral bed of sustained low strings under a single held horn note, mixed well beneath the voice at an even level throughout, with no build and no resolution.",
        "subject": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/huggingface/documentation-images/resolve/main/diffusers/astronaut.jpg",
        "voice": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Xenova/transformers.js-docs/resolve/main/jfk.wav",
        "num_frames": 124,
        "width": 960,
        "height": 544,
        "num_inference_steps": 20,
        "weights_dtype": "{int4}"
    },
    "steps": [
        {
            "name": "chained_reference_to_video_audio",
            "pipeline": {
                "configuration": {
                    "component_type": "ModularPipeline",
                    "pre_load_modules": [
                        "sdnq"
                    ],
                    "cache": {
                        "type": "first_block",
                        "threshold": 0.1
                    },
                    "load_components": {
                        "dtype": "torch.bfloat16",
                        "quantization_config": {
                            "transformer_ref": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "variable:weights_dtype",
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "use_quantized_matmul": true,
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false,
                                    "modules_to_not_convert": [
                                        "proj_in",
                                        "audio_proj_in",
                                        "context_embedder",
                                        "time_embedder",
                                        "time_proj",
                                        "token_refiner",
                                        "norm_out",
                                        "proj_out",
                                        "audio_proj_out"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "text_encoder": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "variable:weights_dtype",
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false,
                                    "modules_to_not_convert": [
                                        ".model.visual",
                                        "lm_head"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "vae": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "{int8}",
                                    "quant_conv": true,
                                    "use_quantized_matmul_conv": true,
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "components": {
                        "transformer_ref": {
                            "group_offload": {
                                "offload_type": "block_level",
                                "num_blocks_per_group": 1,
                                "use_stream": true,
                                "record_stream": true,
                                "low_cpu_mem_usage": true
                            }
                        },
                        "text_encoder": {
                            "remove_modules": [
                                "lm_head"
                            ]
                        },
                        "text_encoder.model": {
                            "truncate_layers": {
                                "language_model.layers": 51
                            },
                            "group_offload": {
                                "offload_type": "leaf_level"
                            }
                        },
                        "vae": {
                            "device": "cuda",
                            "residency": "on_demand"
                        },
                        "audio_vae": {
                            "device": "cuda",
                            "residency": "on_demand"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "from_pretrained_arguments": {
                    "model_name": "MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3",
                    "workflow": "ref2va"
                },
                "chain": {
                    "match_audio": true,
                    "continuity": "last_frame",
                    "segment_argument": "references",
                    "trim_frames": 2,
                    "fps": 24,
                    "frame_snap": {
                        "modulus": 17,
                        "remainder": 5,
                        "min_frames": 124,
                        "max_frames": 345
                    }
                },
                "arguments": {
                    "prompt": "variable:prompt",
                    "references": [
                        {
                            "reference_type": "diffusers.modular_pipelines.minimax_h3.MiniMaxH3ImageReference",
                            "from_file": "variable:subject"
                        },
                        {
                            "reference_type": "diffusers.modular_pipelines.minimax_h3.MiniMaxH3AudioReference",
                            "from_file": "variable:voice"
                        }
                    ],
                    "num_frames": "variable:num_frames",
                    "width": "variable:width",
                    "height": "variable:height",
                    "num_inference_steps": "variable:num_inference_steps",
                    "output": [
                        "videos",
                        "audio",
                        "sampling_rate"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "result": {
                "content_type": "video/mp4",
                "fps": 24
            }
        }
    ]
}
